WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.616
Sprite felt more dirt fall on her.

2
00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:09.437
But then the machine grew quieter.

3
00:00:09.438 --> 00:00:15.521
"The machine is leaving," she said.

4
00:00:15.522 --> 00:00:18.154
"Let's go, Feather!"

5
00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:26.116
Feather and Sprite turned back into fairies. "Phew!"

6
00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:29.507
They climbed out of the dirt.

7
00:00:29.508 --> 00:00:36.662
Feather coughed and spat out dirt.

8
00:00:36.663 --> 00:00:40.742
"Are you okay?" Sprite asked.

9
00:00:40.743 --> 00:00:43.909
Feather brushed dirt off her wings.

10
00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.903
"I'm fine," she said.

11
00:00:46.904 --> 00:00:51.572
"Let's get away from here!"

12
00:00:51.573 --> 00:01:04.727
Soon Sprite and Feather were back at Bert's apartment.

13
00:01:04.728 --> 00:01:15.527
Feather planted the flowers on the balcony.

14
00:01:15.528 --> 00:01:21.821
Sprite poked Hob. "What have you been doing—sleeping?"

15
00:01:21.822 --> 00:01:26.665
"No!" Hob snapped. "We've been busy."

16
00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:31.359
"We learned all about butterflies," Bumble said.

17
00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.567
"Did you know they drink from mud puddles?

18
00:01:34.568 --> 00:01:38.089
And they have really long tongues!"

19
00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.624
Feather patted the dirt around the last flower.

20
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:45.244
"The garden looks beautiful.

21
00:01:45.245 --> 00:01:48.736
Soon the butterflies will come!"

22
00:01:48.737 --> 00:01:54.245
"Um . . ." Bumble stared at the flowerpots.

23
00:01:54.246 --> 00:01:57.981
"You got the wrong kind of flowers.

24
00:01:57.982 --> 00:02:01.963
Butterflies don't like those flowers."

25
00:02:01.964 --> 00:02:04.510
Feather's wings drooped.

26
00:02:04.511 --> 00:02:08.987
"We have to go back to the meadow?"

27
00:02:08.988 --> 00:02:13.060
"No." Sprite pointed to Hob and Bumble.

28
00:02:13.061 --> 00:02:16.270
"You two learned which flowers butterflies like.

29
00:02:16.271 --> 00:02:18.675
You can go back to the meadow!"

30
00:02:18.676 --> 00:02:30.383
Bumble and Hob sighed and flew off.

31
00:02:30.384 --> 00:02:33.251
They soon returned.

32
00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:38.274
In their arms were lots of colorful flowers.

33
00:02:38.275 --> 00:02:41.691
"That was quick," Feather said.

34
00:02:41.692 --> 00:02:44.844
Hob grinned. "It was easy.

35
00:02:44.845 --> 00:02:53.486
Those lazy workers were taking a break!"

36
00:02:53.487 --> 00:02:58.563
The fairies planted the new flowers and . . .

37
00:02:58.564 --> 00:03:10.249
Butterflies appeared!

38
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.501
Soon Bert ran out to the balcony.

39
00:03:13.502 --> 00:03:16.888
"A butterfly garden!" he cried.

40
00:03:16.889 --> 00:03:28.001
"Just what I wished for."

41
00:03:28.002 --> 00:03:31.241
Feather looked back as they flew off.

42
00:03:31.242 --> 00:03:35.912
"I'm glad the flowers have a new home," she thought.

43
00:03:35.913 --> 00:03:41.449
"The garden is so peaceful—not like a noisy playground."

44
00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:52.708
She smiled. "Maybe I'll come back here!"

